# Python cache
paper/__pycache__/
paper/.claude/
*.spl
!genesis/src/diskio/interface/netcdf/netcdf-3.4/src/macros.make

# cluster/ holds private cluster-access material. The raw email drafts
# (mail_*.md) contain third-party names/contact from a private thread and MUST
# stay untracked. The technical requirements (GENESIS25_wymagania_*_v2.tex/.pdf)
# are force-added (git add -f) into the PRIVATE genesis-2.5 repo only.
# WARNING: do not push master to the public genesis-2.4 fork, or the tracked
# requirements doc (names prof. Wójcik + cluster specs) would become public.
cluster/

# liquid/ (Wójcik LSM / functional-LSM research) is a SEPARATE, unpublished
# project, not part of the genesis-2.5 accelerator release. Scrubbed from
# master's history 2026-07-27 ahead of making this repo public -- must stay
# untracked here.
liquid/

# Journal submission material: the editor-facing PDFs and, critically, the
# reviewer reports for SOFTX-D-26-00952. These are correspondence about the
# work, not the work, and the reports are the reviewers' text rather than ours.
# The manuscript source and its built PDF stay tracked; these do not.
paper/SoftwareX/
paper/SOFTX-*.pdf
paper/declarationStatement.docx
paper/drafts/
*.pdf.bak
